{"speciesId":647,"names":{"fr":"Keldeo","es":"Keldeo","en":"Keldeo","ja":"ケルディオ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il projette de l’eau depuis ses sabots et se déplace ainsi à grande vitesse. Sa botte secrète est le coup de sabot."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"By blasting water from its hooves, it can glide across water. It excels at using leg moves while battling."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il parcourt le monde en courant à la surface des mers et des cours d’eau. Il apparaît là où l’eau est très pure."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"It crosses the world, running over the surfaces of oceans and rivers. It appears at scenic waterfronts."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"When it is resolute, its body fills with power and it becomes swifter. Its jumps are then too fast to follow."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"When it is resolute, its body fills with power and it becomes swifter. Its jumps are then too fast to follow."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il parcourt le monde en courant à la surface des mers et des cours d’eau. Il apparaît là où l’eau est très pure."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Corre por mares, ríos o cualquier superficie acuática de todo el mundo. Aparece en aguas límpidas."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"It crosses the world, running over the surfaces of oceans and rivers. It appears at scenic waterfronts."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"海や 川など 水面を 走り 世界中を 駆け巡る。 美しい 水辺に 現れる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Lorsqu’il est résolu, de l’énergie sature son corps et le propulse à des vitesses qui dépassent la perception humaine."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Cuando está decidido, su cuerpo rebosa brío, y es capaz de saltar más alto y correr más de lo que la vista alcanza."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"When it is resolute, its body fills with power and it becomes swifter. Its jumps are then too fast to follow."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"覚悟を 決めることで 全身に 力が みなぎって 素早くなり 飛び跳ねると 残像が みえる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Il parcourt le monde en courant à la surface des mers et des cours d’eau. Il apparaît là où l’eau est très pure."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Corre por mares, ríos o cualquier superficie acuática de todo el mundo. Aparece en aguas límpidas."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"It crosses the world, running over the surfaces of oceans and rivers. It appears at scenic waterfronts."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"海や 川など 水面を 走り 世界中を 駆け巡る。 美しい 水辺に 現れる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Lorsqu’il est résolu, de l’énergie sature son corps et le propulse à des vitesses qui dépassent la perception humaine."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Cuando está decidido, su cuerpo rebosa brío, y es capaz de saltar más alto y correr más de lo que la vista alcanza."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"When it is resolute, its body fills with power and it becomes swifter. Its jumps are then too fast to follow."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"覚悟を 決めることで 全身に 力が みなぎって 素早くなり 飛び跳ねると 残像が みえる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Cobaltium, Terrakium et Viridium lui ont appris à se battre. Il poursuit son entraînement en parcourant le monde."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Aprendió a luchar bajo la tutela de Cobalion, Terrakion y Virizion. Ahora recorre el mundo perfeccionando su destreza."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"Cobalion, Terrakion, and Virizion taught this Pokémon how to fight. It dashes across the world, seeking more opportunities to further its training."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"コバルオン テラキオン ビリジオンに 戦いを 学んだ。 世界を 駆け巡り 修行を 続ける。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Lorsqu’il livre un combat difficile, la corne sur son front se renforce et se dével